{"name":"-54-A-12","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Click—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I thought you wouldn't pick up.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"AR18","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,70"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_2","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Lyudmila","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'll hang up when I have to. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, we've got one last bit of time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"AR18","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Does Professor Hume count as my \"mother\"?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"AR18","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lyudmila","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why are you so fixated on this question?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"AR18","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If he's my \"mother\", then that makes us sisters.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And if he's not, then wouldn't I be a big joke?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"AR18","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lyudmila","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Am I crazy?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"AR18","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, of course not.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"AR18","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lyudmila","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then you're not a joke."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR18","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lyudmila","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Arthur Hume. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That was his real name."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Erma freezes, as though she doesn't know how to reply. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, she's not willing to let time tick by just like that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You will always have a key to the Summer Garden.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR18","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lyudmila","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah, I know."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_disconnect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Click— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Lyudmila hangs up, and then she sighs heavily. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...For some reason, what little nervousness she had left is completely gone now."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She suddenly plants her hand on the wall of the train carriage."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A moment later, her athletic frame launches itself upward and lands on the roof of the carriage."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"background","value":"523","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_3","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The meandering train is like a great rotting serpent. The air is filled with the gloom of night, and the moon hanging on the edge of the sky is faintly tinged with a lonesome red. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Crouching on top of the carriage, Lyudmila scans the sky around her with eagle eyes. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"At this moment, she is like a hawk, gathering strength for a power dive. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She studies her prey mercilessly."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whoosh—! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She retrieves a couple of IR beacons from her waist pouch and tosses them to either side of the train. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This small movement is enough to alert the patrolling troopers."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Select","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Soldier A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There's someone on the roof!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bang-bang-bang—!!!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Soldier A","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"\"Scheelite\" hailing \"Chlorite\", suspicious target sighted escaping on top of the long snake!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A hail of bullets throws up a shower of sparks on the train roof in an instant."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Cloak_Whoosh","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"shake","value":"%%type_id=2%%duration=2%%delay=0.1%%range=8","raw":"controll_shake"},{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whoosh— "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Meanwhile, Lyudmila's athletic form instantly fades from view."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bang-bang-bang—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Soldier","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Team_Running","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Soldier A",