ain nearly graze her on the temple."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She looks up, and her blazing eyes seem to burn through the scant clouds in the night sky."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR18","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,70"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lyudmila","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Ten minutes, exactly."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"523","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Gunfire","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Her stick is like a scepter, establishing a hero's throne for her. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The ruined serpentine bulwark acts like a divine beast under her command and helps her banish the annoying disruption."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Right now, she is bathed in firelight. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She holds her head high atop this mass of steel."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_keyboardtype_sci","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Lyudmila","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Allied region has been marked. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Safe zone is 150-200 meters out—cleared to open fire."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Following her crisp yet sonorous statement, the communicator beeps in response."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"B